      "content": "That makes sense for the physical indicators. Beyond the storefronts and property values, I'm also seeing a lot of talk in the community about \"changing demographics\" or shifts in the local population in some of these districts. From a purely economic risk perspective, do shifts in the local demographic makeup or changes in the cultural/social makeup of a neighborhood impact the stability or long-term predictability of small business loan performance?",
